OL,3,GNEWSALancashire 'should not follow
OL,4,AGreater Manchester'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elected mayor for Lancashire should
OL,7,Fnot be granted the same powers as in
OL,8,Fcity regions like Greater Manchester, a
OL,9,Fcounty councillor has suggested.
OL,11,FReform UK's Ged Mirfin believes any
OL,12,Ffuture Lancashire mayor should focus on
OL,13,Ftransport, jobs and investment, with
OL,14,Flocal councils retaining responsibility
OL,15,Ffor day-to-day services.
OL,17,FHe said Lancashire's mix of towns,
OL,18,Fcities and rural communities made it
OL,19,Funsuitable for a city-region style
OL,20,Fmayoralty.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
