OL,3,GNEWSALancashire 'should not follow
OL,4,AGreater Manchester'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMirfin added: "Any mayor that comes to
OL,7,Fpower needs to be representing a much
OL,8,Fmore diverse range of communities than
OL,9,Fa single city region based upon one
OL,10,Fvery large city."
